{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"alias":"pyrite-cockeyed-gannet","creation_channel":"mcp","description":"## Context / Problem\nFive artifacts exist only because a cutover once needed a bar to clear: `src/rebar/llm/review_kernel/discovery_shadow.py` (389 LOC, docstring \"RP-06 S7 — the cross-gate discovery SHADOW comparator\", zero src importers, only `tests/unit/test_review_discovery_shadow.py:22`); `src/rebar/llm/plan_review/fidelity_spot_eval.py` (492 LOC, epic-c81c spot evals, no CLI, Make, or CI dispatch, `main()` at `:407-461` unreachable; its two pure helpers `_verdict_decision` `:79-86` and `_majority_decision` `:127-137` are imported by `src/rebar/llm/evals/provider_parity.py:51-56` and must be relocated); `src/rebar/llm/code_review/workflow_ops.py:774 shadow_compare` (callers only `tests/unit/test_code_review_discovery.py:265,268,281`); `src/rebar/llm/workflow/gate_dispatch.py:35-41` re-export of `_attach_code_review_metrics` whose comment says it exists for `tests/unit/test_code_review_fp_ledger.py` (11 call sites; canonical home `src/rebar/llm/code_review/finalize.py:171`); `src/rebar/llm/workflow/lint_refs.py:34-39,730` pass-through of `ENGINE_INJECTED_INPUTS` (its canonical home is `lint_expr.py`; the other three names are genuinely used in `lint_refs.py` and stay). ADR 0111 (`docs/adr/0111-no-internal-only-compatibility-shims.md:38-56`) forbids internal-only shims. `tests/unit/workflow/test_legacy_helper_retirement_09f6.py` is a string-absence tombstone (`\"pass4_coach\" not in` 7 files); ADR 0111 `:108-112` declines new mechanisms for shim absence and ADR 0116 `:15,40` rejects tombstoning as a default, so it is deleted. `src/rebar/llm/parity.py` STAYS: `provider_parity.py:44,47` imports it; only its docstring `:1-4` naming LangGraph is residue. Cites are on origin/main 2e81cb9767c1.\n\n## Approach\n1. `git rm src/rebar/llm/review_kernel/discovery_shadow.py tests/unit/test_review_discovery_shadow.py`; delete `docs/review-kernel.md:200-208` (the `APPROVED_DELTAS` sentence and \"The shadow comparator\" paragraph).\n2. Move `_verdict_decision` and `_majority_decision` into `src/rebar/llm/parity.py` as public `verdict_decision` and `majority_decision` (the names `provider_parity.py:52,55` already alias them to). Rewrite `provider_parity.py:49-56` to `from rebar.llm.parity import ItemRecord, majority_decision, verdict_decision` (keep `:44`). Then `git rm src/rebar/llm/plan_review/fidelity_spot_eval.py src/rebar/llm/eval_specs/fidelity_spot_eval_results.json tests/unit/test_fidelity_spot_eval.py`. Rewrite `parity.py:1-4` docstring to \"the non-inferiority parity bar `provider_parity` scores verdict agreement against\". Edit `src/rebar/llm/plan_review/container_stage.py:79-81` docstring, `docs/config.md:433-434` (drop the `fidelity_spot_eval.py` `main()` allowlist clause), `src/rebar/llm/eval_specs/README.plan-review.md:21,25,86-102` and `src/rebar/llm/eval_specs/plan-review-container.eval.yaml:70`.\n3. Delete `shadow_compare` from `workflow_ops.py:774` to the end of the function; delete `tests/unit/test_code_review_discovery.py:259-283`.\n4. `gate_dispatch.py:35-41` becomes `from rebar.llm.code_review.finalize import CODE_REVIEW_STEP_IDS` (still used at `:443`); delete the `:289` marker comment; in `test_code_review_fp_ledger.py` add `from rebar.llm.code_review.finalize import _attach_code_review_metrics` and replace the 11 `gate_dispatch._attach_code_review_metrics(` calls (`:195,211,225,240,259,277,299,337,353,388,404,428`).\n5. `lint_refs.py:34-39` drop `ENGINE_INJECTED_INPUTS`; drop it from `__all__` at `:730`; `src/rebar/llm/workflow/lint.py:27` becomes `from .lint_expr import ENGINE_INJECTED_INPUTS` (keep the rest from `.lint_refs`); `tests/unit/workflow/test_contracts.py:19` becomes `from rebar.llm.workflow.lint_expr import ENGINE_INJECTED_INPUTS`; rewrite `lint_expr.py:11-13` docstring (no re-export claim).\n6. `git rm tests/unit/workflow/test_legacy_helper_retirement_09f6.py`.\n\n## Scope\nThe six artifacts above and their exclusive tests and docs. Out of scope: `parity.py` (live), `src/rebar/llm/code_review/shim.py` (`code_review/__init__.py:22` public entry), `src/rebar/llm/evals/plan_replay/legacy_v4_baseline.py` (`tier0.py:102,106` live impact function), `tests/unit/test_gate_engine_cutover.py`, `provider_parity.py:88 AGENTIC_SOLVERS` (owned by the eval-harness epic; this story edits only `:49-56` of that file, and the recorded file-impact overlap serialises the two through next-batch).\n\n## Testing\nEdit: `tests/unit/test_plan_review_prerequisites_continuation_heldout.py:8,59,120` (delete the `fse.prerequisite_packing_spot_eval` monkeypatch test); `tests/unit/test_container_roster.py:21,110-115` (drop `fidelity_spot_eval` from the roster tuples; `pass1` and `eval_solver` remain); `tests/unit/test_subcall_class_selection.py:343-345,602-603` (delete the `fidelity_spot_eval.py::_relocation_requests` rows); `tests/unit/test_parity_bar.py:248` (retarget the import); `tests/unit/test_rp01_s5_authoritative_oracle.py:232-235`: replace `assert \"fidelity_spot_eval.py\" in files` (the only computed-mode consumer, `fidelity_spot_eval.py:101`) with a synthetic assertion `assert _scope_constructs_structured(ast.parse('def f(p):\\n    mode = \"structured\" if p else \"findings\"\\n    RunRequest(mode=mode)\\n'), {})`, keeping the `jira_dc_capability_map.py` assertion. Add `tests/unit/test_parity_bar.py::test_verdict_decision_and_majority_decision` (FAIL gives block, findings give block, PASS gives advisory, tie gives block). `.github/complexity-baseline.json:49` is unaffected; deleted symbols bucket `stale`.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] `git grep -n \"discovery_shadow\\|fidelity_spot_eval\\|shadow_compare\\|_attach_code_review_metrics\" -- src docs` returns only `code_review/finalize.py` hits.\n- [ ] `git grep -n \"ENGINE_INJECTED_INPUTS\" -- src tests` shows importers only from `lint_expr`; `lint_refs.py` contains no such name.\n- [ ] `python -c \"from rebar.llm.evals import provider_parity; print(provider_parity.verdict_decision({'verdict':'FAIL'}))\"` prints `block`.\n- [ ] `git ls-files tests/unit/workflow/test_legacy_helper_retirement_09f6.py tests/unit/test_review_discovery_shadow.py` prints nothing.\n- [ ] `make verify` exits 0; `python scripts/check_mechanism_delta.py --check` reports `new=0`.","id":"dc42-a2ce-bee2-4da6","parent_id":"87d8-8bb6-5226-4a5b","priority":2,"tags":["complexity-reduction","breaking-pass-4"],"ticket_type":"story","title":"Delete finished-cutover scaffolding: shadow comparators, the fidelity spot-eval harness, and private re-exports"},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"CREATE","timestamp":1788805295821955237,"uuid":"c5841d4c-54d3-4dde-a438-93fea19cc12a"}